span style=\"font-size:15px;\"><strong>Is GLYDE water-resistant or waterproof? Can it be safely used or cleaned near water?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkvC75IMaw_childItem_6","label":"ggkvC75IMaw_childItem_6","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\"><strong>What if I need a new fade-band or blade—are replacements available?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg35SOmZJzA_text","label":"gg35SOmZJzA_text","default":"<p>Totally. GLYDE is made for people who’ve never picked up clippers before. The app walks you through each step visually and audibly. Plus, the fade-band and auto-adjusting blade handle the hard parts—so your results look sharp.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg51ODzeVgt_text","label":"gg51ODzeVgt_text","default":"<p>You won’t. GLYDE is designed to adapt. If you move too fast, the blade retracts and gives a gentle beep. If your angle’s off, it trims less to protect your style. The tech works in real time to guide you and fix small mistakes before they show up.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJwfi0KL_s_text","label":"ggJwfi0KL_s_text","default":"<p>Nope. GLYDE calibrates itself automatically every time you power it on. The internal sensors realign in seconds, so there’s no manual setup or fine-tuning needed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeqDNanIlE_text","label":"ggeqDNanIlE_text","default":"<p>Yep, you’re good offline. Once a hairstyle is downloaded, the app works without Wi-Fi or data. That means you can cut anywhere—at home, in a dorm, or on the go—without worrying about staying connected.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiwDckWDYA_text","label":"ggiwDckWDYA_text","default":"<p>Right now, GLYDE is optimized for head hair only. It’s tuned for fades, tapers, and top trims. Beard and body trimming isn’t supported just yet—but future updates may expand compatibility for those areas with consistent-length trimming.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwoXruKa16_text","label":"ggwoXruKa16_text","default":"<p>GLYDE isn’t waterproof, so it’s best to keep it dry and away from water. But cleaning is still easy—the kit includes a brush and lubricating oil for safe, manual upkeep.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRh9v6r2Cv_text","label":"ggRh9v6r2Cv_text","default":"<p>Yep. Your GLYDE kit includes the essentials, and if you ever need a replacement, you can order parts directly from our website or Amazon. No need to worry—keeping your GLYDE in top shape is easy and accessible.</p>"}],
